As the days went by, Wafa started to feel crushed by the experience. It's late night. I feel extremely tired. But I'm afraid to go to bed. In some ways, Wafa was attempting to do what civil disobedience movements around the world have done. He was deliberately putting himself in harm's way in order to draw attention to a problem and affect change.
随着日子一天天过去，瓦法开始感到被这段经历压垮了。已经是深夜了。我觉得非常疲惫。但我害怕去睡觉。在某些方面，瓦法试图做世界各地的公民抗命运动所做的事情。他故意让自己陷入险境，以引起人们对某个问题的关注并推动变革。

